# Dashboard configuration.
#
# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.production`) before building.

# The Hikmalayer node this dashboard talks to.
#
# Defaults to http://127.0.0.1:3000 when unset. The value is baked into the
# bundle at build time AND added to the page's `connect-src` CSP, so the
# dashboard can actually reach it.
#
# Two other places must agree with this origin:
#   * the node's CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS must list the dashboard's origin;
#   * if you serve the CSP as an HTTP header (recommended), that header's
#     connect-src must include this value too.
#
# To point one already-built bundle at a different node without rebuilding,
# serve a small inline script that sets `window.__HIKMALAYER_NODE__` before
# the app loads — it takes precedence over this value.
VITE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:3000
